    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but what's the point of \"moving forward\" when everything feels so hollow? i look at the future and i just see this massive, embarrassing hole where my life was supposed to be. it feels like the version of me that mattered is already dead. it would be so much easier to just... stop trying to fix something that's fundamentally broken beyond repair. everything feels so heavy, and the thought of starting over just feels impossible.",
